> > 	}
> > 
> > ...
> > 
> > 	if (XXX->irq_wake_enabled)
> 
> No need to duplicate a flag which IRQ core already has.
> 
> See, for example, commit
>  aef3ad103a68 ("serial: core: remove unneeded irq_wake flag")

